  "question": {
    "text": "The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
